      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, the adult woman in <Picture 1> remains in the same bedroom, the same clothes, and the same pose. The camera holds a static shot. She looks straight into the lens with lowered eyelids and parted lips, her chest rising on deeper breaths, her shoulders dropping, and her upper body leaning a short distance toward the lens. Her hips shift once toward the camera and stay there. Her mouth opens further and lets out breath only.\n\noverall_soundscape: Close breath grows heavier as she leans in, with one soft shift of fabric. A low, wordless exhale leaves her open mouth.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A",
